   CBSPeople.all()                        everyone active (open lists: attendees, people involved, training).
   Pickers tagged data-people="key" (select, or the datalist behind an input) are filtered automatically; the selected/saved name is never removed.
   Builders (RAMS, CPHSP, CoSHH, toolbox talk, team meeting, incident report, pre-start, PO, inspections, permits, survey) are tagged here by the
   picker's label (Prepared by, Site lead, Approved by, Presented by, Assessed by, Signed off by, Ordered by, Inspected by, Issued by, Surveyor...),
   only when the picker actually lists people (never filter dropdowns like "All people"). Assigned to / Assignee (job tasks, programme, snags) = Tasks tick;
